    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "Machine learning engineers consider more than just the shape of a decision boundary when deciding on an approach to a classification problem.\r\n\r\n**☑️ Do This:**\r\n\r\n- Chat with AI to help you determine whether nearest neighbors or a decision tree will be the better approach for your problem.\r\n- In your Project Planning Guide, respond to the questions in **Step 4: Chatting About an Approach**.\r\n\r\n**Tip**\r\n\r\nTry a prompt like this:\r\n\r\n> I’m trying to determine whether nearest neighbors or a decision tree is the better approach for solving a classification problem. My problem is ____. How should I think about which approach is better?\r\n",
    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
